        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Chat Interface</title>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background-color: #ededed;\n    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 20px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .chat-container {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 500px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 20px;\n  }\n  .message-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 12px;\n  }\n  .message-row.left {\n    flex-direction: row;\n  }\n  .message-row.right {\n    flex-direction: row;\n    justify-content: flex-end;\n  }\n  .avatar {\n    width: 40px;\n    height: 40px;\n    background-color: #dcdcdc;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #666;\n    text-align: center;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    padding: 2px;\n  }\n  .bubble {\n    max-width: 75%;\n    padding: 12px 16px;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    position: relative;\n    word-wrap: break-word;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n  }\n  .white-bubble {\n    background-color: #ffffff;\n    color: #000000;\n  }\n  .white-bubble::before {\n    content: '';\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 14px;\n    left: -8px;\n    border-top: 6px solid transparent;\n    border-bottom: 6px solid transparent;\n    border-right: 8px solid #ffffff;\n  }\n  .green-bubble {\n    background-color: #95ec69;\n    color: #000000;\n  }\n  .green-bubble::after {\n    content: '';\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 14px;\n    right: -8px;\n    border-top: 6px solid transparent;\n    border-bottom: 6px solid transparent;\n    border-left: 8px solid #95ec69;\n  }\n  .number-badge {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    width: 22px;\n    height: 22px;\n    background-color: #8ba3c7;\n    color: white;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    margin-right: 6px;\n    vertical-align: text-bottom;\n    font-weight: normal;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"chat-container\">\n\n  <div class=\"message-row left\">\n    <div class=\"avatar placeholder\">[Avatar:<br>Sea]</div>\n    <div class=\"bubble white-bubble\">\n      <span class=\"number-badge\">6</span> 这个精读的过程可能要重复几遍，好的文献不是读一遍就完事，每读一遍你都会获取新的信息。读第二第三遍的时候，在电脑打开word，开始一遍读一边记录要写进你文献综述的部分，注意要用自己的话重述。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"message-row left\">\n    <div class=\"avatar placeholder\">[Avatar:<br>Sea]</div>\n    <div class=\"bubble white-bubble\">\n      <span class=\"number-badge\">7</span> 最后将所有文献进行整理引用，把同一小主题的贴在同一段中，也可以加上小标题，使自己的文章更有逻辑，条理更清晰\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"message-row left\">\n    <div class=\"avatar placeholder\">[Avatar:<br>Sea]</div>\n    <div class=\"bubble white-bubble\">\n      <span class=\"number-badge\">8</span> 尽量找出不同论文中矛盾冲突的点，凸显出学术圈思维碰撞的火花，学会用however,on thecontrary,in contrast这类连接词。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"message-row left\">\n    <div class=\"avatar placeholder\">[Avatar:<br>Sea]</div>\n    <div class=\"bubble white-bubble\">\n      你重新写吧\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"message-row right\">\n    <div class=\"bubble green-bubble\">\n      好的，谢谢老师\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"avatar placeholder\">[Avatar:<br>Person]</div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
